; The meshbox showcase: three props for a small forest game, sharing one palette.
; One voxel is 1/16 m, as in Diamon's sprites; each model's pivot is at its feet.

palette props
  k #3b2417   ; dark wood
  w #6b4423   ; wood
  W #94643a   ; light wood
  m #5c6370   ; iron
  M #8f97a3   ; light iron
  g #e8b830   ; gold
  r #a8322a   ; cap
  R #d24a3a   ; cap, lit
  s #f2e8d0   ; spots and stem
  S #d2c2a0   ; stem, shaded
  G #4f8a3a   ; grass

; A toadstool: a stem in a tuft of grass, and a domed cap with pale spots.
